      "message": "fix(ui): draw the machine's rotary kinematics in sim playback (#4266)\n\nA work-turning rotary (turns_part) turns the work about the stated\nrotary axis line and the spindle stays upright - the machine-frame\npose the posed-steel gate judges with. The playback timeline carries\nthe axis line (sim::Seg/Frame::work, display only, default None) and\nthe renderer stands the tool upright at the carried tip while the\npart, the stock and the steel ride the turn. A pose the rotary cannot\nstand upright, or no machine rotary data, keeps today's tip-relative\ndraw (the fallback). A head has no stated gauge-line pivot, so it\nkeeps the fallback too - noted, not guessed.\n\nFixes #4266",
