      "message": "test(sim): pin Frame::work through Script::at (#4266)\n\nNeoTech's review of 55d4b8677 asked for a sim-side test that reads\nFrame::work. script_at_rides_the_work_line_and_none_outside_it pins:\nthe seeded rotary axis line rides the frame at an indexed playhead\n(origin and dir exactly as seeded), the turn angle read off the frame\naxis follows the pose about that line, the line holds through the\ndwell window and the past-window arm, and a prismatic op - mid-move,\npast-window and past the end, plus every arm of an empty script and\na non-finite t - carries None.\n\nRefs #4266",
